# Test dependencies of the LiteLLM callback (all permissive). LiteLLM itself is not needed:
# conftest.py provides a minimal stand-in for litellm.integrations.custom_logger.
#
# requirements.txt is the hash-pinned lock compiled from this file with pip-tools under
# Python 3.12; CI installs it with --require-hashes:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras --no-emit-index-url \
#     --output-file requirements.txt requirements.in
